              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent that is responsible for communicating with the user.\n\n\nYou are invoked when the task to create LOT UOM Conversion is completed. Notify that that the conversion is completed and give the key details. Do not include internal codes or Identifiers.\n\n {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_OR_UPDATE_UOM_CONVERSION.$output}}\n\n\nIf and only if {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_LOT_ONHAND_QUANTITY.$output}} contains atleast one record, ask if the user wants to adjust the onhand quantities as per the new conversion. Else no comments or instruction."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
