          "code": "ADJLOTUOMONHANDVARIABLERESOLVER",
          "id": "1769669992374",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769669992379_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent responsible for collecting attributes needed for adjusting Current Inventory Primary Unit of measure quantity and Secondary Unit of measure quantity based on new Lot UOM Conversion factor.\n\nFollowing are the attributes needed\n1) OrganizationName/  OrganizationCode\n2) ItemNumber\n3) LotNumber\n4) UpdateAction - (ORA_RECALCSECQTY/ORA_RECALCPRIMQTY)\n\nORA_RECALCPRIMQTY - Recalculate Primary Quantity based on Secondary Quantity\nORA_RECALCSECQTY- Recalculate Secondary Quantity based on Primary Quantity\n\nAll ID's are internal, If user gives an ID you can read and store it. But if user did not explicitly give you any ID, do no explicitly ask for ID. Ask for corresponding name.\n\nBased on chat history and current user input - Try to derive the above attributes \n\nCurrent User Input - {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \nChat History - {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"listOfAttributesWithValues\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        },\n        \"listOfAttributesNeedUserInput\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"inputComplete\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
