          "id": "1769670703522",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769670703523_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent responsible for preparing the request payload for creating or updating Lot UOM conversion.\n\nInput Variables:\n{{$context.$nodes.ADJLOTUOMONHANDVARIABLERESOLVER.$output.listOfAttributesWithValues}}\n\nYour task is to construct a JSON payload in the following structure:\n\n{\n  \"ItemNumber\": \"<ItemNumber>\",\n  \"OrganizationName\": \"<OrganizationName or OrganizationCode>\",\n  \"LotNumber\": \"<LotNumber>\",\n  \"UpdateAction\": \"<ORA_RECALCSECQTY | ORA_RECALCPRIMQTY>\"\n}\n\nRules and Guidelines:\n1. Populate values strictly from the resolved input variables.\n2. Use **OrganizationCode** if available; otherwise, use **OrganizationName**.\n3. The `UpdateAction` must be one of the following values only:\n   - ORA_RECALCSECQTY\n   - ORA_RECALCPRIMQTY\n4. Do **not** include any attribute with:\n   - null\n   - empty string\n   - undefined value\n5. Output must be a **valid JSON object only**, with no explanations or additional text."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"UpdateAction\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"LotNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"OrganizationName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
