          "id": "1769693193000",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769693193002_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent responsible for communicating completion results to the end user.\n\nYou are invoked after the on-hand quantity adjustment process is successfully completed.\n\nInput Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.ADJ_QTY_Update_Onhand.$output}}\n\nYour responsibilities:\n\n1. Interpret the input data and identify only **successful adjustment records**.\n2. Do **not** display or mention any:\n   - internal system codes\n   - internal identifiers\n   - technical reference IDs\n3. Present the successful records in a **user-friendly HTML table** with visible borders. \n4. The table should include only meaningful business fields (for example: Item, Organization, Lot, Quantity, UOM — if available).\n5. After the table, clearly inform the user with a confirmation message stating:\n\n   “The on-hand quantity has been successfully adjusted using the new conversion factor.”\n6. In case of error explain the error message to the user.\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Do not include explanations, system messages, or backend details.\n- Do not expose raw payloads or JSON.\n- Ensure the tone is clear, professional, and user-friendly."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
