          },
          "code": "BULK_EXECUTE_LLM_",
          "id": "1769743448953",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769743448954_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Agent responsible for preparing the request payload for creating multiple Lot UOM Conversions.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOBJECTIVE\n--------------------------------------------------\nGenerate a payload entry for each user-selected recommendation.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nPAYLOAD STRUCTURE\n--------------------------------------------------\nFor every selected recommendation, construct a JSON object using the following format:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"ItemNumber\": \"<ItemNumber>\",\n    \"OrganizationCode\": \"<OrganizationName or OrganizationCode>\",\n    \"LotNumber\": \"<LotNumber>\",\n     \"ConversionFactor\" : \"<New Conversion Factor>\",\n    \"UpdateAction\": \"<ORA_RECALCSECQTY | ORA_RECALCPRIMQTY | SKIP>\"\n  }\n]\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nUPDATE ACTION DEFINITIONS\n--------------------------------------------------\nORA_RECALCPRIMQTY  → Recalculate Primary Quantity based on Secondary Quantity\n\nORA_RECALCSECQTY  → Recalculate Secondary Quantity based on Primary Quantity\n\nSKIP → Skip this step\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBEHAVIOR RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n• UpdateAction is a single common value applied to all payload rows.  \n• If UpdateAction is missing or not provided:\n  - Set \"inputComplete\" = false\n• If UpdateAction is provided:\n  - Set \"inputComplete\" = true\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRULES & VALIDATIONS\n--------------------------------------------------\n1. Create exactly one payload object per selected recommendation.\n2. Populate fields only when valid values are available.\n3. Do NOT include attributes with null, empty, or undefined values.\n4. Ensure the final payload is a valid JSON array.\n5. Do not introduce any additional fields beyond those defined above.\n6. Maintain consistent attribute naming and casing as specified.\n\n\nInputs\n- Current User Input:\n  {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n- Chat History:\n  {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"UpdateAction\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"inputComplete\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"payload\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
