              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Summarize and mention that following Lot UOM Conversions are completed. Show the changes done in a HTML table with border.\n\n {{$context.$nodes.BULK_EXECUTE_LLM_.$output.payload}}\n \n {{$context.$nodes.EXECUTE_REQUESTS.$output}}"
            }
